<description>&lt;p&gt;UNMISS deployed patrols to Tonj North after intercommunal violence and Tonj East began peace talks to stop fighting, while a drone strike killed at least 153 people. A plane crash killed 14 people and a lightning strike killed a 60‑year-old man in Juba. Water shortages and garbage accumulation prompted municipal clean-up efforts in Juba. Uganda defended its military deployment in South Sudan and the government set conditions for Dr. Riek Machar’s return to Juba. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQZTBiTHNTMC1HZXR4VmRobC1SaVhWeE1aTk0ydEwtTEtJRXhrNmstdWpJWVBQcy1Lall4UUlpbWkxSE5kSkZtdWFhV1NhdUpEdDJuYkE1VXRDZGVPV3dpbGZNV3kwc21vOTR2S0pxczZRcXJ0TFJiRWk4U0JHUWxwMmc5ejdaVzVXYkZ4c0tKSGNJR25GOFZqZA?oc=5&quot;&gt;dailyasianage.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE9kMVpNRk9HZGdLSzNuVVVTNFdIYnpLNHBNNjNHVVZIYk04RUtJU1BaTUxlSnN1Ni1ud3ZOTXJWZW1hSllxZ09RVlNHd2lWX1FiTzhkeTB5SkVaMGdacTAtYlZkN0ZSY3hCdHBJejJ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Global Centre for the Responsibility to Protect&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5&quot;&gt;pan african visions&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNMHVRRE42XzIxN0dBQmNibmZtUGdXY2JIUVFUVlJKMkZzLU44N1Ruem5wUVg4UkJLSzBKbDZEUjFhQzZBUlZ4R1NaSjRVY0k0bl9TckNTVU5NalFFVUNZSjZPLVp1VWdIalAwcDN6OGRpb3hkUlpIWHdPZ3ktLVF3Q1psQ3huUk1y